<title>SINGAPORE: General Magnetics 1995/96 loss deepens.</title>
<headline>General Magnetics 1995/96 loss deepens.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss				  1.62 vs   0.34</p>
<p>    Loss per share (cts)		  1.62 vs   0.34</p>
<p>    Turnover				 23.12 vs  27.75</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.11 vs   0.14</p>
<p>    Operating profit			4.31 vs   4.82</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    0.44 vs   0.73</p>
<p>    Depreciation			    5.41 vs   4.53</p>
<p>    Loss from associates		  0.29 vs    nil</p>
<p>    Write-back of deferred tax	  0.27 vs   0.24</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (loss) 0.06 vs   0.15 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - General Magnetics Ltd makes magnetic media and telecommunications equipment.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
